  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Among Heavenly Court Gu Immortals, Qin Ding Ling hates Longevity Heaven most deeply after being forced to become Giant Sun’s immortal concubine. She recalls that at the crucial moment of the fate war, Giant Sun immortal zombie’s attack tilted the final battle in his favor.",
      "chapters": [
        2043
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-war-memory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan brings Hei Lou Lan into Luck Suppression Heavenly Palace in immemorial black heaven to seek an audience. Hei Lou Lan sees Immortal Zombie Giant Sun sitting cross-legged on a cushion mat, and bloodline reaction plus his appearance confirm the identity; she kneels and greets Ancestor Giant Sun. He lifts her with a formless gentle force, calls Hei tribe Gu Immortals unfilial for surrendering to Bai Zu, and orders Hei Lou Lan to cultivate in Luck Suppression Heavenly Palace so she can later rebuild Hei tribe in Northern Plains.",
      "chapters": [
        2075
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "audience-with-an-ancestor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "house_luck_suppression_heavenly_palace",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "fac_bai_zu_tribe",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Zombie Giant Sun summons Hei Lou Lan again and tells her to risk her life by entering Myriad Beast Fusion Color Heaven if she wants a chance to surpass Gu Yue Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        2111
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "myriad-beast-fusion-color-heaven-order",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_myriad_beast_fusion_color_heaven",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Calamity Luck Altar he sits at the main seat and orders the target to be Divine Emperor City.",
      "chapters": [
        2174
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-cave-stretch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "house_divine_emperor_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the ninth layer he still fights in an immortal zombie body and treats Heavenly Court as the main enemy while allying with Fang Yuan against Star Constellation Immortal Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        2186
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-cave-stretch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the Door of Life and Death, Immortal Zombie Giant Sun uses golden top ox hair to seize Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s giant arms and appears amid golden light drizzle. After Spectral Soul awakens, even Fang Yuan and Immortal Zombie Giant Sun can use only about fifty percent of their strength under soul path dao mark suppression. Narration calls Immortal Zombie Giant Sun a Dao Lord as well, yet notes he cannot amplify himself with outside luck path dao marks inside that Door.",
      "chapters": [
        2194
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luck-path-dao-lord",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_door_of_life_and_death",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "sys_dao_lord"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Qin Ding Ling’s luck gamble, Immortal Zombie Giant Sun’s luck is vast at Dao Lord level, mostly good luck with little bad luck. With that combat system cracked and Qin Ding Ling impeding him, his battle strength falls sharply against Star Constellation Immortal Venerable, and stacked flying star injuries leave him close to death.",
      "chapters": [
        2201
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luck-gamble-and-near-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "While still an immortal zombie, his blood is ice-cold immortal zombie black blood, his skin is dry and black like a withered tree, his eyes are dark and dim, and his back is slightly hunched. Near death, his body burns with blood-red flames as a killer move draws blood path divine power from Longevity Heaven, with familial emotion Gu as first core and imitation Gu transformed into blood relation Gu as second core. His ice-cold immortal zombie black blood turns gold, dry black skin regains white luster, thorn-like hair grows to his shoulders, golden light fills his eyes, and he stands tall as a middle aged man over nine feet. Narration states Giant Sun Immortal Venerable has completely revived, ending the immortal zombie form in that stretch.",
      "chapters": [
        2203
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "revival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_familial_emotion_gu",
        "gu_imitation_gu",
        "gu_blood_relation_gu",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    }
  ],
